think Cross-dir imports: rye resolves nested @import relative to the importing path, so base58check.rye reached from crypto/ needs its own shims (crypto_sha256.rye, base58.rye) in crypto/ too, matching the seated encoding/crypto_sha256.rye symlink pattern. Added four flat-named symlinks in crypto/.
