obs The count guard globbed crypto/*.rye with ls, which caught the four new import-shim symlinks and would break the bijection. Fixed it to count real files only (find -type f) — a correct, necessary ratchet now that crypto compositions import cross-directory. Guard prints 41, bijection holds.
